  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9702.02 “Authorizing official” means an official exercising authority promulgated under RSA 31:95-b, RSA 37:6, or RSA 23:1.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
